sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant VendorContract as VendorContract
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+VendorContract: markExpired()
    Note over VendorContract: Policies: vendorContractRead, vendorContractWrite, vendorContractExecute
    Note over VendorContract: Guards (3)
    VendorContract->>VendorContract: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;active#quot;
    VendorContract->>VendorContract: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    VendorContract->>VendorContract: guard[2]: self.endsAt != null and self.endsAt <= now()
    VendorContract->>VendorContract: mutate.status
    VendorContract->>VendorContract: mutate.expiredAt
    VendorContract->>EventBus: emit VendorContractExpired on vendor_contract.expired
    VendorContract-->>-Client: void